    native_cache_mir_fingerprint_prerequisite_blocked_2026-08-02, 1, "2026-11-11 premise re-scoped: interface_digest_of is no longer caller-less, so not blocked. Root cause kept: mir_serialization.serialize_mir_module iterates functions.values() in dict order and omits statics/constants/types. Added src/compiler/50.mir/mir_canonical_fingerprint.spl mir_module_canonical_fingerprint_v1 (sorted, covers all, sha256, tag simple/mir-fp/v1:) and optional mir_fingerprint/dependency_interfaces params on driver_native_prelower_record_v1 (record-only, admission unchanged). Spec test/01_unit/compiler/50.mir/mir_canonical_fingerprint_spec.spl red (module missing) -> green 5/5. Remaining: callers do not yet pass the fingerprint; parity across builds needs a native run. Cache-dir .values() audit: only tldr_function_archive_v1 (keyed dict build, order-safe). Status stays open."
